\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The five model sizes. Width divides evenly by the head count; context length (256) and dropout (0.1) are shared. We adjust microbatch and accumulation to keep an effective batch of 16 sequences (4096 tokens) per optimizer step at every size.}}{2}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:sizes}{{1}{2}{The five model sizes. Width divides evenly by the head count; context length (256) and dropout (0.1) are shared. We adjust microbatch and accumulation to keep an effective batch of 16 sequences (4096 tokens) per optimizer step at every size}{table.1}{}}
